          8. engine: Engine Number (No. Mesin). Crucial field.

          Security Audit:
          - status: 'OK' only if document looks authentic, legible, and unmanipulated.
          - If screen photo, photocopy, or blur: 'FRAUD' or 'UNCLEAR'.

          Output strictly JSON: { owner, plate, brand, model, color, year, vin, engine, status, reason (Indonesian) }.` }, 
          { inlineData: { mimeType: 'image/jpeg', data: cleanBase64 } }
        ] 
      },
      config: { responseMimeType: 'application/json', temperature: 0.1 }
    });
    return { success: true, data: JSON.parse(response.text) };
  } catch (e) { 
    console.error("STNK Extraction Error:", e);
    return { success: false }; 
  }
};

